        "TileImage": "$($repository 9b0d0651-4f81-40e5-bf2a-5aec6fd763a5).Image",
        "Description": "Good Afternoon 47,\r\rEdward &quot;Ted&quot; Mendez is planning to have a meeting with Robert Knox where he will contract Krondstat via the US Military to develop nuclear-capable bipeds to &quot;keep the peace.&quot;\r\rAlongsize Mendez, his right-hand man, Miles Hopson, will be nearby. He has intimate knowledge of these so-called &quot;metal gears&quot;, so he must be removed as well.\r\rFinally, the two guards patrolling the aquarium must be eliminated because fuck em lmao\r\rGood Luck, 47.",
